    "locator": "What is Avana?",
    "contentHash": "96cf74da81054cb02ade3a7860e71004f16d54ba1a4b12b907927829e6153c01",
    "text": "Avana FAQ > What is Avana?\n\nAvana lists Uniswap v3, Uniswap v4 and Aerodrome Slipstream LP positions as collateral on Aave V4. A position inside a listed band is credited once, at pledge. The vault token is priced by that market's LPOracle from Aave V4's own token prices. Borrowing, interest and health are Aave's."
