    "locator": "Where does the price come from?",
    "contentHash": "8fb662a1d511601a1f65614063ba7d10bf0077b69cca997e6742ff46c652e73b",
    "text": "Avana FAQ > Where does the price come from?\n\nThe LPOracle reads `AaveOracle.getReservePrice` on the CDP Spoke's price Spoke. It does not read a Chainlink feed of its own, a pool spot price, or an AMM TWAP. Aave rejects a zero price. Avana adds only an overflow bound."
