    "text": "Avana FAQ > Is there a circuit breaker?\n\nNo. Avana does not pause itself. A debt reserve or a keeper is removed by the Joint Configuration Safe at once, or by the governance Safe after 12 hours. Freezing or pausing an Aave reserve is Aave's control."
