    "text": "Avana FAQ > Who governs a change?\n\nEach chain has its own AccessManager. The governance Safe schedules listings and parameter changes. The delay is 4 to 5 days, or 12 hours for removing a debt reserve or a keeper. The Aave governance executor is admin and can cancel a scheduled call. The Emergency Guardian holds no role."
